{"ID":"20240314091113-fa7g2u1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20240314091113-fa7g2u1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091113-fa7g2u1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240318114715-oyp5vl5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506174004-38c44cf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:6507,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240318114715-oyp5vl5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"方便法门","type":"doc","updated":"20240519170733"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240314091113-govrf4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314091113-govrf4e","updated":"20240417181714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、小孩子吐奶、全身水肿、得水则吐：五苓散（常常吐奶）；小半夏加茯苓汤（偶发的吐奶）；"}]},{"ID":"20240314161024-poh3q1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314161024-poh3q1t","updated":"20240315150525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、暖中焦：理中丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240315150520-ya7i6co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315150520-ya7i6co","updated":"20240315150543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、四肢厥逆，冷到膝盖：四逆汤；通脉四逆汤"}]},{"ID":"20240326082211-tdsvwy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326082211-tdsvwy6","updated":"20240326082221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.1、寒气厥逆：赤丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240326082222-7eakhlt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326082222-7eakhlt","updated":"20240326091524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.2、文字稿：寒气厥逆呢，是全身有水肿的现象，所以说你如果看到病人是水肿，四肢厥逆，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"有积水，用赤丸；没有积水，四肢冰冷，这就是四逆汤证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。这种差异就在一个有水，一个没水；"}]},{"ID":"20240314143433-gzbw409","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314143433-gzbw409","updated":"20240320143420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、类风湿性关节炎、手指变形：乌头桂枝汤；乌头汤（有心脏疾病勿用，麻黄太强，用乌头桂枝汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20240320142829-voqimed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320142829-voqimed","updated":"20240320142928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头汤（蜜）制作方法：乌头一两，哦，你用水去煮，哦，用两碗水，两碗水呢把它煮成一碗，这个当你加热过以后，已经少掉很多毒性了。那这一碗水呢你把乌头就丢掉啦，那这个剩下的是乌头水，是不是乌头水？这个时候合蜂蜜一碗。蜂蜜呢本身可以解乌头的毒，那这里有一碗蜂蜜，加上一碗的乌头水，两个和在一起，是不是两碗？！这个时候你再用火去滚，变成一碗。所以这个时候变成一碗的浓度，跟生蜂蜜的浓度是一样的，并没有改变，但颜色是黑的。这是我们制作乌头蜜的最标准最好的方式；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240326092523-7xjw3xp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326092523-7xjw3xp","updated":"20240326092537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4.2、那我之所以用这个乌头桂枝汤来治疗风湿关节炎，就上次我跟诸位介绍过，因为麻黄，因为病人很多病人呢心脏都不好，开麻黄下去吃的时候，心脏都会动悸，他不好的原因可能吃西药吃得太多，造成这样子，所以我都用这个来治疗风湿关节炎的。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"实际上真正的治疗那个类风湿性关节炎，应该用乌头汤，而不是用乌头桂枝汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，但是我用乌头桂枝汤，因为原因在这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240315150546-mz10jn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315150546-mz10jn1","updated":"20240318104245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、破伤风：伤口处会有红线，从红线往前一寸艾灸，红线就会慢慢退，一直跟着退势灸，直到红线退至手指处即可结束；"}]},{"ID":"20240318104133-xuwsol8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318104133-xuwsol8","updated":"20240318104436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、驱虫药：肉桂+艾草煮水，喷在身上可防蚊虫；麻油擦拭身体，也可防蚊虫；"}]},{"ID":"20240318104411-caa0ban","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318104411-caa0ban","updated":"20240318140515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、脑膜炎（为痉病，区分有汗无汗）：栝蒌桂枝汤（有汗，柔痉）；葛根汤（无汗，刚痉）；大承气汤（胸满口噤，卧不着席）；"}]},{"ID":"20240318114649-o2heou9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318114649-o2heou9","updated":"20240318114715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、婴儿或小孩胸腹腔有痰水：控涎丹；"}]},{"ID":"20240318114715-oyp5vl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318114715-oyp5vl5","updated":"20240318145032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、中耳炎耳朵发炎：麝香矾石散；"}]},{"ID":"20240318145033-l81bna8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318145033-l81bna8","updated":"20240318150210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10、眼睛的红疹，红血丝啊，眼屎很多化脓发炎：大黄泡水喝；"}]},{"ID":"20240318114754-zlwawgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318114754-zlwawgo","updated":"20240318152155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11、皮肤表面上的湿：麻黄加术汤（湿疹，痒）；"}]},{"ID":"20240318151502-dypxi87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318151502-dypxi87","updated":"20240318151506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11.1、我们皮肤表面上的湿疹，红、荨麻疹，统统都可以用这个处方来治；"}]},{"ID":"20240318151657-djt43g8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318151657-djt43g8","updated":"20240318151703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11.2、病人缺氧，哦，缺氧，因为它能够去湿嘛，哦，比如说在山湾里面，这个人突然昏倒，因为很湿啊，湿气很多就会昏倒。还有过去呢，跑到山洞里面去，洞穴里面探险啊，里面很湿啊，或者沼气，遇到毒气，沼气瓦斯啊，那昏迷过去，都可以用麻黄加术汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240318151205-clgtyhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318151205-clgtyhx","updated":"20240318153612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12、疣在皮肤、头皮多（头皮多是湿）、脂溢性皮肤炎、手脚皮很厚：麻杏薏甘汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240318152106-mixu36t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318152106-mixu36t","updated":"20240318152125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12.1、表面上那个红红的长了那个黏黏的粘巴巴很多都是湿疹，你不要管它名称是什么，在皮肤表面上又痒，然后一看到湿的，麻黄汤加白术对不对，比较不痒就长一个东西在哪边，就肌肉里长出来，但它还不痒。不痒不是在皮肤，所以说疣并不是在皮肤上长出来，是在肌肉中长出来，就是说你开麻黄加术汤没有用，你要开麻杏薏甘汤，诶一下子疣就收掉了；"}]},{"ID":"20240318151944-9wdkig7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318151944-9wdkig7","updated":"20240319084817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"13、中暑：白虎加人参汤；瓜蒂散；"}]},{"ID":"20240319084817-xk22w1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319084817-xk22w1e","updated":"20240319084832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"13.1、治疗中暑，经方只有两个处方，白虎加人参汤和瓜蒂散；"}]},{"ID":"20240319084833-w8dln7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319084833-w8dln7i","updated":"20240319101825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"14、百合病：百合地黄汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"无误治"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"单纯百合病）；百合知母汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"误发汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；百合滑石代赭汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"误下之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；百合鸡子汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"误吐之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；百合洗方（一月不解，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"有渴症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；栝蒌牡蛎散（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"渴整不解者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；百合滑石散（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"变发热者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；"}]},{"ID":"20240318151149-kunpljm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318151149-kunpljm","updated":"20240319103919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"15、狐惑病、梦游、凭依症：甘草泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240319103919-cnrucre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319103919-cnrucre","updated":"20240411150823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16、腹膜炎、胆囊破裂或盲肠破裂、阑尾破裂：赤豆当归散（当归赤豆散）；"}]},{"ID":"20240319114959-x6rec94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319114959-x6rec94","updated":"20240319115124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16.1、脓疡在骨头或蔓延到骨头；或脓疡呢是在皮肤下面，或者肌肉里面很深的地方：术附汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240319115125-51nlxqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319115125-51nlxqs","updated":"20240319140806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17、带状疱疹：龙胆泻肝汤（阳毒）；升麻鳖甲汤（阳毒）；升麻鳖甲汤去雄黄蜀椒（阴毒）；用灸法灸；"}]},{"ID":"20240319140806-537jxlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319140806-537jxlf","updated":"20240319145534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18、疟疾：鳖甲煎丸（疟母）；用补血补津药味配伍对治（瘅疟）；白虎加桂枝汤（温疟）；蜀漆散、牡蛎汤（牡疟）；柴胡去半夏加栝蒌汤（劳疟）；柴胡桂姜汤（寒疟）；"}]},{"ID":"20240319144317-ppmz1qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319144317-ppmz1qt","updated":"20240319153221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19、面部中风：桂枝汤加葛根；"}]},{"ID":"20240319153221-sha3j5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319153221-sha3j5j","updated":"20240319155403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脑中风急救法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：从病人左额头剃方寸头发，烧成灰，用吸管将灰吹入左边的耳朵中——出自黄帝内经；"}]},{"ID":"20240319155400-m7ho9jb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319155400-m7ho9jb","updated":"20240319155433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20.1、喷进去后根据古时的案例病人鼻子嘴巴会吐血出来，人就醒过来了；"}]},{"ID":"20240319155250-07vo567","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319155250-07vo567","updated":"20240319161427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21、妄行独语不休：大承气汤（实症）；防己地黄汤（虚症）；"}]},{"ID":"20240319161428-zrvpksu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319161428-zrvpksu","updated":"20240319162024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22、热症中风：风引汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240319162024-qgu0vpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319162024-qgu0vpy","updated":"20240319174155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23、中风（辩证使用详见方剂）：千金三黄汤；小续命汤；术附汤；补阳还五汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240319173211-eecvm9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319173211-eecvm9s","updated":"20240320171018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24、风湿、痛风：桂枝芍药知母汤（膝盖风湿痛，或临近阴天雨天就感觉膝盖痛）；"}]},{"ID":"20240320171020-768vzil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320171020-768vzil","updated":"20240320171146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24.1、牡蛎味咸可攻坚，如病人浑身有肿瘤，桂枝芍药知母汤重用牡蛎；"}]},{"ID":"20240320140405-hrrrhrp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320140405-hrrrhrp","updated":"20240411134452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25、乳癌：术附汤加减；仙方活命饮；"}]},{"ID":"20240321153614-o8r13qp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321153614-o8r13qp","updated":"20240321153707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25.1、瓦楞子长得像乳房，味咸能软坚，倪师常用于治疗乳房硬块、甲状腺的硬块、淋巴癌；"}]},{"ID":"20240320140414-u6a2hbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320140414-u6a2hbl","updated":"20240320140919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26、奶水堵塞，没法排下消导成月经：四物汤加炒麦芽——《奇方异录》，如力量不够，加味重用桂枝；"}]},{"ID":"20240320141139-49y5sbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320141139-49y5sbp","updated":"20240320141202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26.1、加重桂枝能增强力量的原因："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝跟炮附子都能装心阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"主要药性在于壮心脏的火，强它的火，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"主要药性在于将心火下降到小肠里；"}]},{"ID":"20240426115005-e9vp9lh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240426115005-e9vp9lh","updated":"20240426131400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26.2、胸部有硬块也可以用该方，出自“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"仲景心法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”，个人感觉应该属于程度较轻的硬块；该处方是最初期预防乳癌的处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240320140921-tlh6qe5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320140921-tlh6qe5","updated":"20240320144340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27、红斑性狼疮：桂枝芍药知母汤的加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240320144341-u55e3q5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320144341-u55e3q5","updated":"20240320150635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28、脚气：矾石汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240320152509-5embgoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320152509-5embgoe","updated":"20240320152529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.1、文字稿：任何的脚上的发的病一直往身上走，就叫做“脚气冲心”，所以说，千万不要说被......这个经方就是这样子啊，“脚气冲心”，他脚气有很多原因，你不要去看什么病名，只要看到脚红肿、发炎，红肿那个从脚一发起来，肿起来，一直往身上走，就是冲心......往心脏走，这个你都可以用外面的外洗方来泡脚，都可以使用矾石汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240320150635-nktih8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320150635-nktih8k","updated":"20240320154820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29、劳证：桂枝芍药知母汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240320154820-qanfpo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320154820-qanfpo1","updated":"20240321114629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30、遗精：桂枝龙骨牡蛎汤；小建中汤（虚劳里急而梦失精）；"}]},{"ID":"20240320165902-251025d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320165902-251025d","updated":"20240321145202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31、肾气过旺，头发油多：三黄泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240321145202-cg24t7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321145202-cg24t7r","updated":"20240321150243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"32、失眠：酸枣仁汤；黄连阿胶汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240320140741-ewyrqyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320140741-ewyrqyu","updated":"20240321152646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33、甲状腺肿瘤：消肿溃坚汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240321152647-q12n9t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321152647-q12n9t5","updated":"20240322100626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34、肺气肿：越婢加半夏汤（抽烟或戒烟导致的呼吸不畅）；厚朴麻黄汤（咳而脉浮）；泽漆汤（咳而脉沉）；小青龙加石膏汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240321163131-i8r67y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321163131-i8r67y6","updated":"20240321163740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35、消渴有三：上消：渴饮千杯不能止渴；中消：饥食百碗不能解饥；下消：阳不举；"}]},{"ID":"20240321163734-8gfxu0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321163734-8gfxu0x","updated":"20240321163744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35.1、上消、中消可用白虎加人参汤加减，下消用桂附八味丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240321163153-h7us0u7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321163153-h7us0u7","updated":"20240321165755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"36、寒饮咳嗽：射干麻黄汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240321165756-9ihnnts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321165756-9ihnnts","updated":"20240321171908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37、浓痰、胶痰：皂荚丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240321171841-lsowps3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321171841-lsowps3","updated":"20240321174213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37.1、戒烟方（详见皂荚丸篇介绍）：皂荚三钱红枣十枚苦参三钱黄芩二钱黄柏三钱黄连二钱半夏二钱南星二钱；"}]},{"ID":"20240321172937-cf0bdqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321172937-cf0bdqp","updated":"20240321174215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38、阴部发炎：单味苦参煮水外洗；"}]},{"ID":"20240321173039-dz3pl1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321173039-dz3pl1t","updated":"20240411125417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"39、气喘应急，宣肺：甘草麻黄汤（麻黄2钱甘草3钱，3碗煮一碗，应急用，服用后喘就停掉）；"}]},{"ID":"20240322090157-hvt2cpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322090157-hvt2cpk","updated":"20240322091024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40、手热、脚热导致的睡不着：三黄泻心汤（文字稿中，倪师因病人便秘，将黄柏替换成大黄，又有加味苦参，用此方者后续也可辩证而用）；"}]},{"ID":"20240322090818-ihja8mw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322090818-ihja8mw","updated":"20240322091450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41、干咳、失音：麦门冬汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240322091451-n59a6hw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322091451-n59a6hw","updated":"20240322092127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42、怀孕期间的咳嗽：麦门冬汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240322092127-y35lcqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322092127-y35lcqg","updated":"20240322092443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"43、肺结核（干咳，火气上逆）：麦门冬汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240322100229-42grjqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322100229-42grjqw","updated":"20240322100251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44、肺痿：甘草干姜汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240322100458-ovxbj47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322100458-ovxbj47","updated":"20240322100539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45、肺痈：葶苈大枣泻肺汤；千金苇茎汤；桔梗汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240322110323-ksk1plw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322110323-ksk1plw","updated":"20240322110354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46、往来寒热：小柴胡汤（兼有恶心）；桂枝麻黄各半汤（没有恶心）；"}]},{"ID":"20240322110731-6uygxdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322110731-6uygxdu","updated":"20240322114024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"47、奔豚症：奔豚汤（往来寒热，气上冲胸）；桂枝加桂汤；茯苓桂枝甘草大枣汤（苓桂甘枣汤，欲作奔豚，脐下动悸）；"}]},{"ID":"20240329101602-n92vwnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329101602-n92vwnk","updated":"20240329101631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"47.1、脐下动悸用茯苓，脐上动悸用桂枝，脐后动悸桂枝茯苓同时用；"}]},{"ID":"20240322110945-nuv2qdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322110945-nuv2qdl","updated":"20240322112800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48、皮肤、麻疹内陷：二仙汤（白芍+黄芩）；"}]},{"ID":"20240322112802-ffu420w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322112802-ffu420w","updated":"20240325101344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"49、心脏疾病、胸痹痛（心包有痰饮）：栝蒌薤白白酒汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"较浅的心脏病，喘息咳唾，胸背痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；栝蒌薤白半夏汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"较严重，不得卧，心痛彻背"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；枳实薤白桂枝汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心中痞气，气结在胸，胃胀，实症型"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；人参汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚症时候的胸闷，隐隐作痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；公孙内关胃心胸+天突巨阙关元，然后 20 分钟以后，背后第十椎下（针灸）；乌头赤石脂丸（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"最严重，心痛徹背，背痛徹心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；"}]},{"ID":"20240322160900-h1mojnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322160900-h1mojnz","updated":"20240322162936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"50、心脏闭锁不全、狭心症：栝蒌薤白白酒汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240322160916-k2btc7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322160916-k2btc7v","updated":"20240410172013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51、打嗝：橘皮加生姜煮水喝（虚热）；吴茱萸汤（虚寒）；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"或通脉四逆汤加葱白（胃气将绝时用，该用法于吴茱萸汤方提及）；"}]},{"ID":"20240410172017-wpw4er6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410172017-wpw4er6","updated":"20240410172132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51.1、会用到茯苓四逆汤都是病人胃气将绝，最后一搏使用的；"}]},{"ID":"20240325090833-vv5122m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325090833-vv5122m","updated":"20240325091237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"52、风湿性心脏病：薏苡附子散；"}]},{"ID":"20240325091237-dk8ie4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325091237-dk8ie4k","updated":"20240325100235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53、心包炎：桂枝生姜枳实汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240325100235-ku4ekn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325100235-ku4ekn7","updated":"20240325112241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54、动脉血管堵塞、动脉血管硬化：黄连阿胶汤去白芍；"}]},{"ID":"20240325111437-9zqezeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325111437-9zqezeb","updated":"20240325171553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55、肠子套叠：附子梗米汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240325171554-aj4h8t0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325171554-aj4h8t0","updated":"20240415092620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56、孕期呕吐：干姜人参半夏汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240325175106-mopoo3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325175106-mopoo3d","updated":"20240326081955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57、寒实：上焦寒实（三物小白散）；中焦寒实（甘草干姜汤）；下焦寒实（大黄附子细辛汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20240326091401-ox00a1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326091401-ox00a1r","updated":"20240326091415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58、腹中满，上冲皮起，出见有头足：大建中汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240326091416-ebup6yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326091416-ebup6yj","updated":"20240326091443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58.1、文字稿：为什么看到有头足呢？实际上就是肠胃在蠕动，还有动脉脉搏在底下，腹部的动脉可以蠕动，你可以看到肚子在动啊，真的是看到肚子在动，就会有这种症状"}]},{"ID":"20240326081957-qd855en","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326081957-qd855en","updated":"20240409163929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"59、小青龙用在表寒里寒，大青龙用在表寒里热；大乌头煎用在寒疝；"}]},{"ID":"20240326091310-42v3yyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326091310-42v3yyy","updated":"20240326091626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60、寒疝：大乌头煎；当归生姜羊肉汤；乌头桂枝汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240326091502-vs7g22a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326091502-vs7g22a","updated":"20240326095035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61、吐剂：瓜蒂散；浓盐汤（浓盐水）；"}]},{"ID":"20240326095036-7fclh67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326095036-7fclh67","updated":"20240326154315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62、肾着、代脉冷如坐水中：甘草干姜苓术汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240326095439-ztwjp06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326095439-ztwjp06","updated":"20240411122655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63、肺癌：桔梗甘草汤辩证加味（咳白痰如稀饭颗粒状）；金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"紫参汤或肺癌专论"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”"}]},{"ID":"20240327160525-hteu8w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327160525-hteu8w4","updated":"20240327160708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"64、溢饮：麻黄加术汤（四肢水肿）；"}]},{"ID":"20240327160915-v0ynsb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327160915-v0ynsb0","updated":"20240327160921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"64.1、本来很胖的，现在很瘦，肚子里面咕噜咕噜常常有些水声，这种都是痰饮；"}]},{"ID":"20240327160709-xtdch9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327160709-xtdch9f","updated":"20240328093359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65、头晕、中耳不平衡、神经衰弱：苓桂术甘汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240328092241-eamtnz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328092241-eamtnz8","updated":"20240328093710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66、晕车、晕船：苓桂术甘汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240328093711-13l2oh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328093711-13l2oh1","updated":"20240328165357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67、十枣汤后，喝水时感觉水又回到胃里面来：甘遂半夏汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240328112759-gdwdcj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328112759-gdwdcj1","updated":"20240328165954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68、头晕眩：真武汤；五苓散；苓桂术甘汤；泽泻汤（左肋痛，昏眩时眼前会发黑）；术附汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240328165330-fmtalpi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328165330-fmtalpi","updated":"20240328165528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69、脾脏肿大：泽泻汤+白芍茯苓厚朴；"}]},{"ID":"20240328165528-v2uhyf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328165528-v2uhyf5","updated":"20240329101007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70、喝水太快，导致隔间有水，呕吐、心下痞，眩悸：小半夏加茯苓汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240329101008-upnewg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329101008-upnewg3","updated":"20240329101338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71、小孩子口水多：五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20240329101338-sgyha2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329101338-sgyha2f","updated":"20240329102448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72、癫痫（一看到水就发癫痫）：五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20240329102449-jgc9v7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329102449-jgc9v7v","updated":"20240329111426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73、脑袋感觉好像戴了帽子：茯苓桂枝五味甘草汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240329111427-70gsue7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329111427-70gsue7","updated":"20240329153439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"74、渴欲饮水，不止：文蛤散；五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20240329153335-nvuxgtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329153335-nvuxgtc","updated":"20240329155054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"75、血糖太高、血糖太低：白虎汤加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240329154438-by39bhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329154438-by39bhr","updated":"20240329155558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76、上消：白虎人参汤加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240329155544-cefe6bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329155544-cefe6bg","updated":"20240329155604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"77、中消：白虎汤加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240329155547-w2lf4lw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329155547-w2lf4lw","updated":"20240329155608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"78、下消：金匮肾气丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240329101550-xz4fk46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329101550-xz4fk46","updated":"20240401141438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79、淋病：栝蒌瞿麦丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240401143019-ma2z7mt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240401143019-ma2z7mt","updated":"20240416160332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80、糖尿病：白虎加人参汤加减；金匮肾气丸加减；当归四逆汤加减；竹叶石膏汤加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240401143119-cn5k9rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240401143119-cn5k9rs","updated":"20240409164120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80.1、糖尿病治疗、尿毒、红斑性狼疮、血癌、雷诺氏症：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"糖尿病专论"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”"}]},{"ID":"20240407104326-jdncah5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407104326-jdncah5","updated":"20240407104335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80.2、尿毒：防己茯苓汤加减"}]},{"ID":"20240506141206-vv891z0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240506141206-vv891z0","updated":"20240506141236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80.3、尿毒：真武汤+五苓散+生附干姜（出处："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"仲景心法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；"}]},{"ID":"20240401143049-nw7r8p4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240401143049-nw7r8p4","updated":"20240402112940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"81、脸肿：采汗法对治；"}]},{"ID":"20240402112940-15djsdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240402112940-15djsdx","updated":"20240407160716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"82、黄汗：黄芪芍药桂枝苦酒汤（表虚）；桂枝加黄芪汤（表实）；"}]},{"ID":"20240406154432-uiycdi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240406154432-uiycdi3","updated":"20240406154441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83、全身性水肿：发汗药+硫磺；"}]},{"ID":"20240406154527-e3vs53q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240406154527-e3vs53q","updated":"20240406154531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83.1、师曰：诸有水者，腰以下肿，当利小便；腰以上肿，当发汗乃愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240406154444-ybs4r9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240406154444-ybs4r9i","updated":"20240406163231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"84、子宫肌瘤：桂枝茯苓丸加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240406154625-frl95gh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240406154625-frl95gh","updated":"20240407093404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"85、发福、虚胖、减肥：防己黄芪汤加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240407093355-tev79wj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407093355-tev79wj","updated":"20240407114741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86、风水：防己黄芪汤；越婢汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240407103434-ncd66qv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407103434-ncd66qv","updated":"20240407114748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87、皮水：防己茯苓汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240407103436-ixfw90s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407103436-ixfw90s","updated":"20240407114750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"88、里水：越婢加术汤（小便利）；甘草麻黄汤（小便不利）；"}]},{"ID":"20240407103438-dsoyhi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407103438-dsoyhi0","updated":"20240407115020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"89、水病，脉沉小：麻黄附子汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240407103442-ry9dshg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407103442-ry9dshg","updated":"20240407152331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"90、厥而皮水者：蒲灰散（外敷，适用汤药没法下肚的情形）；"}]},{"ID":"20240407152448-4b9l8z8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407152448-4b9l8z8","updated":"20240408111940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"91、逆经（月经时流鼻血，不从下面排出）：郁金（一味即愈）；"}]},{"ID":"20240408111942-6tle6p1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408111942-6tle6p1","updated":"20240408171906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"92、黄疸，大便便秘、身黄：茵陈蒿汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240408171916-9g83nj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408171916-9g83nj8","updated":"20240408171939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"92.1、黄疸，小便便秘，身黄：茵陈五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20240408163247-lwupe4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408163247-lwupe4i","updated":"20240408171002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"93、大便黑，肌肤假错：猪膏发煎；"}]},{"ID":"20240408171003-1rpshvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408171003-1rpshvi","updated":"20240408171416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"94、阴吹：猪膏发煎；"}]},{"ID":"20240408171417-8d3e5oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408171417-8d3e5oz","updated":"20240408171444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"94.1、文字稿：阴吹就是在子宫和阴道中间膜上破个洞，结果放屁本来应该从肛门里面出来，结果从阴道里出来，这叫阴吹；"}]},{"ID":"20240408171428-onfryrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408171428-onfryrf","updated":"20240408173819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"95、胆结石：四逆散加减（柴胡三钱、黄芩三钱、枳实、甘草、五倍子、海金沙）；"}]},{"ID":"20240408173828-dq2n3tn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408173828-dq2n3tn","updated":"20240408173838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"95.1、文字稿于大黄硝石汤篇；"}]},{"ID":"20240408173838-ji1nx53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408173838-ji1nx53","updated":"20240408180007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"96、便秘，小便不利且小便赤：大黄硝石汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240408180008-6ctee5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408180008-6ctee5k","updated":"20240409105457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"97、止鼻血：侠白穴；"}]},{"ID":"20240408163239-v5lh99k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408163239-v5lh99k","updated":"20240409154313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"98、心下悸：半夏麻黄丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240409154318-blj6za1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409154318-blj6za1","updated":"20240409154331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99、吐血不止：柏叶汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240409154840-hhjr2q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409154840-hhjr2q9","updated":"20240409161035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99.1、经方止血药：柏叶、阿胶；经方认为，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肚脐以上出血，用柏叶，下焦、阴部出血，用阿胶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240409154331-kaj77z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409154331-kaj77z4","updated":"20240412165813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"100、月经滴漏出血不止、孕期出血不止、流产出血不止：胶艾汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240409155228-g24whqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409155228-g24whqc","updated":"20240409165150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101、胃出血，胃下垂，胃溃疡，胃癌：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃癌专治"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”；"}]},{"ID":"20240411105708-bwuu21m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411105708-bwuu21m","updated":"20240411110009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101.1、黄土汤找不到灶心土，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"可以用赤石脂替代的原因：熟用赤石脂能补肠胃中的破洞；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240409165150-gteq5at","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409165150-gteq5at","updated":"20240409172653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102、痔疮，先血后便：赤豆当归散；"}]},{"ID":"20240409172654-r56ojck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409172654-r56ojck","updated":"20240410111537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"103、头痛：吴茱萸汤（或有呕、手脚冰冷的现象；后项强痛、胃下垂皆有机会用到）；"}]},{"ID":"20240410104457-16x7uxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410104457-16x7uxi","updated":"20240410113617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"104、吴茱萸汤：干呕、腹痛、肠鸣、吐涎沫、头痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240410113617-h3st02f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410113617-h3st02f","updated":"20240410114036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105、呕、恶心、心下痞、肠鸣、腹痛、下痢：半夏泻心汤（如半夏泻心汤无解，可考虑加重生姜量，就变成生姜泻心汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20240410113653-0f4hct6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410113653-0f4hct6","updated":"20240410113706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"106、呕、恶心、心下痞：甘草泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240410113706-og1pl4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410113706-og1pl4r","updated":"20240410151537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107、肾衰竭、尿毒症：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾衰竭与尿毒症处方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”"}]},{"ID":"20240410161656-dtydytd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410161656-dtydytd","updated":"20240410161703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107.1、文字稿：像我们常常在治疗那个尿毒症的时候，如果病人水肿，那我们那个四逆汤或是那个当归四逆汤下去，心脏功能没有办法恢复，我们会用麻黄让它恢复"}]},{"ID":"20240409164002-gjrj2um","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409164002-gjrj2um","updated":"20240410160051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"108、胃反，呕吐：大半夏汤（不渴，大半夏汤症的症状比小半夏汤症状来的要严重一点）；茯苓泽泻汤（吐而渴，欲饮水）；大黄甘草汤（吃了就吐）；"}]},{"ID":"20240410151545-8oxaufm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410151545-8oxaufm","updated":"20240410152102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"109、美容（让皮肤变好）：常喝蜂蜜水（体内不能有伏热）；"}]},{"ID":"20240410152104-4rnkbc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410152104-4rnkbc5","updated":"20240410152313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"109.1、伏热：比如本身便秘，喝了蜂蜜水反而会把它固住，导致脸上长痘；（反之，喝蜂蜜水会长痘说明有伏热）"}]},{"ID":"20240410152222-u3f3p3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410152222-u3f3p3u","updated":"20240410162138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"110、胰脏癌：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胰脏癌专论"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”"}]},{"ID":"20240410153115-q9l92tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410153115-q9l92tc","updated":"20240411094757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"111、脉绝，脉没有了：通脉四逆汤；灸关元、中脘穴；"}]},{"ID":"20240411094619-sg6h7kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411094619-sg6h7kx","updated":"20240411104042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112、谵语：小承气汤；小柴胡汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240411104054-xpebf5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411104054-xpebf5x","updated":"20240411104118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112.1、小柴胡汤治谵语，出自小承气汤篇；"}]},{"ID":"20240411104043-2ntbe7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411104043-2ntbe7k","updated":"20240411104709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113、大肠炎：桃花汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240411104710-12v5b26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411104710-12v5b26","updated":"20240411125752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114、气利（放屁频繁）：诃梨勒散；"}]},{"ID":"20240410172001-936zw9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410172001-936zw9t","updated":"20240411133725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"115、脑疽：阳和汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240411133725-6l5tswk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411133725-6l5tswk","updated":"20240411151837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117、急性盲肠炎（阑尾炎）、肠痈：大黄牡丹皮汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240411144109-x017qvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411144109-x017qvl","updated":"20240411154541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117.1、慢性盲肠炎（隐隐作痛）、肚脐、阴部出脓：薏苡附子败酱散（宿便阻塞在盲肠）；"}]},{"ID":"20240411151937-2n54fhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411151937-2n54fhr","updated":"20240411154047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"注：真正破裂转成腹膜炎的时候，大黄牡丹皮汤、薏苡附子败酱散都不够力，一定要用赤豆当归散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240411151857-dhmevgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411151857-dhmevgi","updated":"20240411174729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"119、胰脏炎：苓桂甘枣汤+排脓散（枳实、芍药、桔梗）；"}]},{"ID":"20240411175622-l6vtsne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411175622-l6vtsne","updated":"20240411175758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120、肺化脓、喉癌、舌癌：排脓汤加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240411175632-j0r8616","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411175632-j0r8616","updated":"20240412083702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"121、走路之前往前走，不能后退也不能刹车：承山穴刺入两寸；"}]},{"ID":"20240412083704-h7ximf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412083704-h7ximf8","updated":"20240412105423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122、手抖：藜芦甘草汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240412105308-kp6bq8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412105308-kp6bq8v","updated":"20240412125340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123、睾丸大小不一、高度不一（疝气）：蜘蛛散；防己黄芪汤；当归四逆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240412125341-vb200fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412125341-vb200fm","updated":"20240412125401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123.1、以上三方皆出自蜘蛛散方讲解；"}]},{"ID":"20240412124857-agrphyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412124857-agrphyl","updated":"20240412135204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124、去虫药：乌梅丸；甘草粉蜜汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240412135205-mvt2csl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412135205-mvt2csl","updated":"20240412150021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125、不孕：温经汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240412150021-9bbaeqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412150021-9bbaeqj","updated":"20240412160359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126、月经延迟、月经痛、子宫肌瘤、子宫一般肌瘤：桂枝茯苓丸（如子宫有严重癌症，加生附子、硫磺，力道更强更快）；"}]},{"ID":"20240412155231-bs4v7aq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412155231-bs4v7aq","updated":"20240415094908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"127、孕期小便不利：当归贝母苦参丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240415094909-f3h8c57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415094909-f3h8c57","updated":"20240415094927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"127.1、孕期全身水肿或下半身水肿、小便不利：葵子茯苓散方；"}]},{"ID":"20240415093704-fkky0u9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415093704-fkky0u9","updated":"20240415101902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128、孕期养妇人的药：当归散；"}]},{"ID":"20240415101645-o65qwok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415101645-o65qwok","updated":"20240415101905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"129、孕期养胎儿的药：白术散；"}]},{"ID":"20240412105258-c1akt8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412105258-c1akt8e","updated":"20240415105341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130、意外伤胎、胎位不正：至阴穴+隐白穴（针灸）；"}]},{"ID":"20240415105140-txqdp5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415105140-txqdp5m","updated":"20240415110854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130.1、胎位不正针法+难产方出自：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"针法补充\u0026amp;难产方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”；"}]},{"ID":"20240415105138-syx6go9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415105138-syx6go9","updated":"20240415124801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"131、产后腹痛，烦满不得卧：枳实芍药散；"}]},{"ID":"20240415124801-o9fehjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415124801-o9fehjz","updated":"20240415151249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"132、产后头微疼、发热、恶寒、心闷、干呕、流汗：阳旦汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240415151249-wb90h8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415151249-wb90h8j","updated":"20240415152649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133、产后中风发热，面正赤，喘而头痛：竹叶汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240415152649-ac9x5ny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415152649-ac9x5ny","updated":"20240418170050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"134、妇人乳中虚，烦乱呕逆，安中益气（奶水不够）：竹皮大丸；多吃鱼；八珍汤（可用于炖鸡）；当归生姜羊肉汤；露蜂房炖鸡；"}]},{"ID":"20240415153730-mte88ab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415153730-mte88ab","updated":"20240415160237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135、断奶方：当归四物汤+炒麦芽；"}]},{"ID":"20240415160240-obvsm8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415160240-obvsm8z","updated":"20240415160952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136、乳癌、有硬块：当归四物汤+炒麦芽五钱+竹茹三钱+防己三钱+紫根三钱+牡蛎五钱+瓦楞子；"}]},{"ID":"20240415160859-blsq2xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415160859-blsq2xh","updated":"20240415160931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136.1、出处：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"竹皮大丸方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”；"}]},{"ID":"20240426160706-j0cfzng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240426160706-j0cfzng","updated":"20240426161831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136.2、乳癌药物配伍不能用蜜蜂房，因为治乳癌是在退乳，而露蜂房是用于生乳；（该条文解释出自仲景心法；这里蜜蜂房可能指的是露蜂房）"}]},{"ID":"20240415155953-245f7xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415155953-245f7xz","updated":"20240415161242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136、产后下利虚极：白头翁加甘草阿胶汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240415161242-utm6t3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415161242-utm6t3s","updated":"20240415165019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"137、经期得到感冒：小柴胡汤症；"}]},{"ID":"20240415165020-j0e0lwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415165020-j0e0lwl","updated":"20240415165741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"138、心脏好像被人握住、喉咙好像有东西梗到：半夏厚朴汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240415165741-2ctwzs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415165741-2ctwzs5","updated":"20240416094033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"139、带下、白带：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"带下补充"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”；"}]},{"ID":"20240415153926-bhl780v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415153926-bhl780v","updated":"20240416100355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"139.1、针灸可针："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三阴交、血海"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，严重者可下腹针"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中极、关元"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，还想好的快一点，下"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"隐白穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240416100347-x7t1udh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416100347-x7t1udh","updated":"20240416100444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"140、助孕：温经汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240416100444-uowo1ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416100444-uowo1ll","updated":"20240416102955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"141、月经隔月来：土瓜根散；"}]},{"ID":"20240416102955-6qfkzkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416102955-6qfkzkj","updated":"20240416114533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"142、淤血堵在子宫里：抵当汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240416114522-9iicpfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416114522-9iicpfn","updated":"20240416151653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"143、梅毒、性病、阴茎烂掉：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"性病补充处方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”；"}]},{"ID":"20240416100430-bd5v3xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416100430-bd5v3xv","updated":"20240416154507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"144、大病初愈，劳动后又复发：枳实栀子豉汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240416154507-05r9x5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416154507-05r9x5s","updated":"20240416154552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"145、大病初愈后，腰以下水肿：牡蛎泽泻散；"}]},{"ID":"20240416154552-d3f20v6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416154552-d3f20v6","updated":"20240417130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146、肝癌临床：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝癌肝硬化病例"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”；"}]},{"ID":"20240417130707-giiwh51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240417130707-giiwh51","updated":"20240421163235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147、腹部的寒痛：小建中汤（小寒痛）；大建中汤（大寒痛）；大乌头煎（大建中汤都没效，同时病人寒湿很盛，口不断的吐白津出来时用）；"}]},{"ID":"20240421163240-k174zrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240421163240-k174zrq","updated":"20240519170733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147.1、出处：金匮要略篇搜索“药性的升与使”；"}]},{"ID":"20240418170028-25i1ipz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240418170028-25i1ipz","updated":"20240425102521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148、痔疮：大承气汤+当归+槐花："}]},{"ID":"20240425102522-phl6223","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240425102522-phl6223","updated":"20240425102534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148.1、出处：仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240425115859-w1svvbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240425115859-w1svvbv","updated":"20240425124932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"149、胆囊破裂：四逆散加味五倍子，海金纱、滑石；（阴症的四逆是四逆汤，阳症的四逆是四逆散）"}]},{"ID":"20240425115912-80nk3x8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240425115912-80nk3x8","updated":"20240425115925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"149.1、出处：仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240425124933-wk7ccnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240425124933-wk7ccnv","updated":"20240426160319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150、乳癌：白虎汤加减（应该在足阳明胃经上）；"}]},{"ID":"20240426145829-tt6npy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240426145829-tt6npy8","updated":"20240426160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150.1、出处：仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240428092028-zi7bhlk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240428092028-zi7bhlk","updated":"20240428092047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"151、小孩子得到血癌（原因是小儿麻痹疫苗）：小建中汤加生附子；"}]},{"ID":"20240428092047-n41opej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240428092047-n41opej","updated":"20240428092100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"151.1、出处：仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240506140640-x8qml5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240506140640-x8qml5s","updated":"20240507141630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"152、关节有问题、关节有响声：桂枝芍药知母汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240506174004-38c44cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240506174004-38c44cf","updated":"20240507141631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"152.1、出处：仲景心法；"}]}]}